  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:390px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orange pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Theft Defense</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e5/My_Hero_Academia_Nine_Air_Wall.gif/revision/latest?cb=20241006015401\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"My Hero Academia Nine Air Wall\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e5/My_Hero_Academia_Nine_Air_Wall.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20241006015401\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e5/My_Hero_Academia_Nine_Air_Wall.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20241006015401 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e5/My_Hero_Academia_Nine_Air_Wall.gif/revision/latest?cb=20241006015401 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"My Hero Academia Nine Air Wall\" width=\"270\" height=\"151\" data-image-key=\"My_Hero_Academia_Nine_Air_Wall.gif\" data-image-name=\"My Hero Academia Nine Air Wall.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Nine (My Hero Academia: Heroes Rising) uses the All For One to wield the stolen Quirk, Air Wall, in order to protect himself against Bakugo's attack.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Use thieving skills/stolen goods to defend oneself.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>use thieving skills/stolen goods to defend oneself</b>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Archetype:Thief\" title=\"Archetype:Thief\">Thief</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Powers\" title=\"Defense Powers\">Defense Powers</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Defense\" title=\"Absorption Defense\">Absorption Defense</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Stealing Defense/Defensiveness</li>\n<li>Theft Defensiveness</li>\n<li>Thief/Thievery Defense/Defensiveness</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can wield their thieving abilities as a means of defense. This can entail using stolen goods as shields, enhancing one’s durability using appropriated power or translating one’s agile burglary skills into evasion capabilities.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Enhanced\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Enhanced\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Supernatural\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Supernatural\">Supernatural Condition</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Defense/Enhanced\" title=\"Defense/Enhanced\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Defense/Supernatural\" title=\"Defense/Supernatural\">Supernatural Defense</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thievery/Enhanced\" title=\"Thievery/Enhanced\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Thievery/Supernatural\" title=\"Thievery/Supernatural\">Supernatural Thievery</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thief_Mode\" title=\"Thief Mode\">Thief Mode</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Powers\" title=\"Defense Powers\">Defense Powers</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Defense\" title=\"Absorption Defense\">Absorption Defense</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Mastery/Enhanced\" title=\"Combat Mastery/Enhanced\">Enhanced</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Combat_Mastery/Supernatural\" title=\"Combat Mastery/Supernatural\">Supernatural Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Power Augmentation\">Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Theft_Combat\" title=\"Theft Combat\">Theft Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Archetype:Thief\" title=\"Archetype:Thief\">Thief</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Bypassing\" title=\"Defense Bypassing\">Defense Bypassing</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Cancellation\" title=\"Defense Cancellation\">Defense Cancellation</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Reduction\" title=\"Defense Reduction\">Defense Reduction</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Defense_Reversal\" title=\"Defense Reversal\">Defense Reversal</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Theft_Nullification\" title=\"Theft Nullification\">Theft Nullification</a></li>\n<li>May only be able to use thievery abilities for limited amount of time.</li>\n<li>Users will be exhausted when too much energy is used.</li>\n<li>May be over-charged/wounded if too much energy is used at once.</li>\n<li>May only be used for defensive purposes.</li>\n<li>Improperly utilized thievery power may result in undesirable effects or no effects at all.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTheft_Defense%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://fairytail.fandom.com/wiki/Faris\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:fairytail:Faris\">Faris/White Wizard</a> (<i>Fairy Tail: 100 Years Quest</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Thief_(Final_Fantasy_X-2)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:finalfantasy:Thief (Final Fantasy X-2)\">Thief Dressphere</a> Users (<i>Final Fantasy X-2</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://herokiller.fandom.com/wiki/Ihwa\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:herokiller:Ihwa\">Ihwa, the Hero Killer</a> (<i>Hero Killer</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hunterxhunter.fandom.com/wiki/Chrollo_Lucilfer\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:hunterxhunter:Chrollo Lucilfer\">Chrollo Lucilfer</a> (<i>Hunter x Hunter</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://kungfupanda.fandom.com/wiki/The_Chameleon\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:kungfupanda:The Chameleon\">The Chameleon</a> (<i>Kung Fu Panda 4</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://majo-taisen.fandom.com/wiki/Bonnie_Parker\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:majo-taisen:Bonnie Parker\">Bonnie Parker</a> (<i>Majo Taisen: The War of Greedy Witches</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://myheroacademia.fandom.com/wiki/All_For_One_(Quirk)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:myheroacademia:All For One (Quirk)\">All For One</a> Users (<i>My Hero Academia</i>)\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://myheroacademia.fandom.com/wiki/Nine?so=search\">Nine</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://myheroacademia.fandom.com/wiki/Toya_Setsuno\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:myheroacademia:Toya Setsuno\">Toya Setsuno</a> (<i>My Hero Academia</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nanatsu-no-taizai.fandom.com/wiki/Ban\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:nanatsu-no-taizai:Ban\">Ban</a> (<i>Nanatsu no Taizai/The Seven Deadly Sins</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260731150346\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.020 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 112/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 189/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.242      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%    8.242      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:538094-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260731150346 and revision id 2837927. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
